{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26938","headline":"和座主相公西亭秋日即事 · 姚合","name":"和座主相公西亭秋日即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西亭秋望好，宁要更垂帘。\n夫子墙还峻，酇侯宅过谦。\n微风红叶下，新雨绿苔黏。\n窗外松初长，栏中药旋添。\n海图装玉轴，书目记牙签。\n竹色晴连地，山光远入檐。\n酒浓杯稍重，诗冷语多尖。\n属和才虽浅，题高免客嫌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}